# Owner-locked UI shells

The owner repeatedly asked to keep the full operational shells. Do **not** replace these route targets with `Native*`, `ShopfrontSourceDataPage` (for Products), or `OrithosRegisterPage` unless the owner explicitly asks in the current chat.

| Route | Required component |
|-------|--------------------|
| `/`, `/sell`, `/register` | `OdooRegisterPage` |
| `/close` | `OdooCloseRegisterPage` |
| `/products` | `OdooProductCataloguePage` (More / totals / Load more) |
| `/purchases` | `PurchasingWorkspace` (Orders / Invoices / Suppliers / Replenishment tabs) |
| `/customers` | `OdooCustomerDirectoryPage` |
| `/suppliers` | `SupplierDirectoryPage` from `OdooSupplierDirectoryPage` |
| `/dashboard` | `OrithosOverviewPage` |
| `/reports/sales` | `ShopfrontSourceDataPage mode="sales"` |
| `/reports/inventory` | `ShopfrontSourceDataPage mode="inventory"` |
| `/reports/purchase` | `ShopfrontSourceDataPage mode="purchase"` |
| `/reports/dashboard` | `ShopfrontReportsOverviewPage` |

Also keep `pos-ui/src/lib/native-pos-host.ts` with an **empty** `NATIVE_POS_HOSTS` set while sell uses the Odoo register.

Ledger/backend native work may continue, but must not silently rewire these page entrypoints. `Native*Page` components may exist for future cutover; they are not the live Stock/Sell shells.
